<section class="docs-page">
  <h1>Documentation &amp; API Reference</h1>

  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>QA Playground is a small storefront app built to practice three kinds of test automation against one realistic codebase:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>UI automation</strong> &mdash; registration, login, product search/filter/sort, cart, checkout, order history, an admin panel with modals, and a contact form.</li>
    <li><strong>API automation</strong> &mdash; a REST API under <code>/api</code> for auth, products, users, and orders.</li>
    <li><strong>SQL data validation</strong> &mdash; a SQLite database at <code>db/qa_playground.sqlite</code> you can query directly and compare against what the UI/API report.</li>
  </ul>

